        `tax year`                                                            IS `the year`
        `period`                                                              IS `the period`
        `column`                                                              IS `the column`
        `income from work in the period`                                      IS `work`
        `income not from work in the period, not exempt under section 350`    IS `other`
        `the minimum wage applicable to the employee`                         IS (IF `the column` EQUALS `an employee` THEN JUST `the full minimum wage in 2026` ELSE NOTHING)
        `received unemployment benefit for a full month under Chapter G`      IS FALSE
        `a volunteer in national service or in community volunteering`        IS FALSE
        `a student in a Torah institution or in a yeshiva`                    IS FALSE
        `serving in civil service as defined in section 6(a) of the Deferral of Service for Yeshiva Students Law` IS FALSE
        `the day the person began national-civic service, if serving in it`   IS NOTHING
        `section 350(c) disapplies section 348(b) to the person`              IS FALSE
        `an order under section 348(c) has changed a minimum amount for the period` IS FALSE

