#ASSERT `the quarter that contains month` 9  EQUALS `the quarter beginning on 1 July`
#ASSERT `the quarter that contains month` 10 EQUALS `the quarter beginning on 1 October`
#ASSERT `the quarter that contains month` 12 EQUALS `the quarter beginning on 1 October`
