§§ `Schedule K item 1 — an employee, 2026`

-- Maximum: 10,382 × 5 = 51,910 a month (the Institute prints 51,910), × 3 a quarter, four quarters a year.
#ASSERT `Schedule K item 1 — the maximum income for a month, under` `the 2026 figures` EQUALS 51_910
#ASSERT `Schedule K item 1 — the maximum income for a quarter, under` `the 2026 figures` EQUALS 155_730
#ASSERT `Schedule K item 1 — the maximum income for a year, under` `the 2026 figures` EQUALS 622_920
-- Minimum: the minimum wage of the quarter's first month: January 6,247.67 (from 1.4.2025), April 6,443.85.
#ASSERT `Schedule K item 1 — the minimum income for a month in` `the quarter beginning on 1 January` `, under` `the full minimum wage in 2026` EQUALS 6_247.67
#ASSERT `Schedule K item 1 — the minimum income for a month in` `the quarter beginning on 1 April` `, under` `the full minimum wage in 2026` EQUALS 6_443.85
#ASSERT `Schedule K item 1 — the minimum income for` `the quarter beginning on 1 January` `, under` `the full minimum wage in 2026` EQUALS 18_743.01
#ASSERT `Schedule K item 1 — the minimum income for` `the quarter beginning on 1 October` `, under` `the full minimum wage in 2026` EQUALS 19_331.55
#ASSERT `Schedule K item 1 — the minimum income for a year, under` `the full minimum wage in 2026` EQUALS 76_737.66

