#ASSERT REFUSED `the figures Schedule K reads for the tax year` 2025 BECAUSE "this row answers contribution periods from January 2026 only"

§§ `Section 348 — which item of Schedule K`

#ASSERT `the item of Schedule K for` (`the case of` `an employee` `in` 2026 `,` (`in month` 1) `, earning` 9_000 `from work and` 0 `not from work`) EQUALS `item 1, an employee`
#ASSERT `the item of Schedule K for` (`the case of` `a self-employed person` `in` 2026 `,` (`in month` 1) `, earning` 9_000 `from work and` 0 `not from work`) EQUALS `item 2, a self-employed person`
#ASSERT `the item of Schedule K for` (`the case of` `neither` `in` 2026 `,` (`in month` 1) `, earning` 0 `from work and` 0 `not from work`) EQUALS `item 4, another insured person`
