#ASSERT ROUND (7_703 TIMES 12.09% PLUS (`s 348 — the income on which contributions are computed, for` (`the case of` `neither` `in` 2026 `,` (`in month` 1) `, earning` 0 `from work and` 12_000 `not from work`) MINUS 7_703) TIMES 12.17%) EQUALS 1_035
